---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 bg-[#1c1b17] text-[#e9e4d6]">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-14">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-10">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display font-bold text-2xl tracking-tight mb-2">后生仔</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#a39c8c] font-serif">纸上得来终觉浅，绝知此事要躬行</p>
      </div>
      <p class="tag text-[#8a8578]">2026 · 记录技术探索与生活感悟</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 border-t border-[#322e25] pt-8">
      <!-- 快速链接 -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="tag text-[#8a8578] mb-4">快速链接</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 font-sans text-sm">
          <li><a href="/posts" class="text-[#a39c8c] hover:text-[#d04a2e] transition-colors">文章</a></li>
          <li><a href="/moments" class="text-[#a39c8c] hover:text-[#d04a2e] transition-colors">朋友圈</a></li>
          <li><a href="/gallery" class="text-[#a39c8c] hover:text-[#d04a2e] transition-colors">相册</a></li>
          <li><a href="/diary" class="text-[#a39c8c] hover:text-[#d04a2e] transition-colors">随笔</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about" class="text-[#a39c8c] hover:text-[#d04a2e] transition-colors">关于</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 联系 -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="tag text-[#8a8578] mb-4">联系</h3>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
          <a href="https://github.com/lsx3320" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[#a39c8c] hover:text-[#d04a2e] transition-colors" aria-label="GitHub">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:15527759825@163.com" class="text-[#a39c8c] hover:text-[#d04a2e] transition-colors" aria-label="Email">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 关于 -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="tag text-[#8a8578] mb-4">关于</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#a39c8c] font-serif leading-relaxed">
          以代码观世界，以迭代修人生；<br />一行一 commit，皆为进化之痕。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 备案信息（居中，标准备案风格） -->
    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-[#322e25] text-center">
      <p class="font-sans text-xs text-[#8a8578]">&copy; {currentYear} 后生仔的博客 · 卢仕潇</p>
      <a
        href="https://beian.miit.gov.cn/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="mt-2 inline-block font-sans text-xs text-[#8a8578] hover:text-[#d04a2e] transition-colors"
      >
        鄂ICP备2024037507号
      </a>
      <p class="mt-3 font-sans text-[11px] text-[#6b6455]">Built with Astro · Cloudflare Pages</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
